A. Commit message:
Prevent pattern matching abuse (CVE-2024-31228) in older version

B. Change summary:
Added a nesting depth limit to the stringmatchlen function to prevent potential stack overflow due to deeply nested patterns.

C. Compatibility Risk:
Low

D. Fixed Code:
